---
const enabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_INQUIRY_ENABLED === 'true';
const email = 'mailto:tech@wearecodelovers.com?subject=Discuss%20my%20project';
---
<section class="border-t border-white/5 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-[32px] border border-rose-400/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-950/60 to-slate-950 p-8 sm:p-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-rose-300">YOUR PROJECT, NEXT</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-4xl">Have a project like this in mind?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">Tell us what you want to build or improve. We’ll review your goals and discuss the scope, the technical approach and a useful next step.</p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5">
        <a href={enabled ? '#project-inquiry' : email} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-rose-600 px-7 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-rose-500">Discuss my project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a href="https://cal.com/codelovers/30min?user=codelovers&overlayCalendar=true&layout=month_view" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-slate-300 underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4 hover:text-white">Or book a discovery call ↗</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-400">A first conversation to understand your project. No newsletter signup.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
